# AI Agent & IDE Indexing Ignore Rules (MuscleCuties)
# Reduces token usage by excluding build outputs, worktrees, large assets, and historical logs.

# Build & IDE artifacts
bin/
obj/
packages/
*.binlog
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage/
*.cobertura.xml
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
.idea/
.vs/
_ReSharper*/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcarchive
*.ipa

# Agent worktrees & local state
.agent-worktrees/
.claude/
.cloud-attachments/
.impeccable/
.freebuff/
artifacts/
graphify-out/
.foundation-baselines/
.scratch/

# Large localization lookup table (read only when tasked with localization)
**/UiTextCatalog.RuntimeText.cs

# Historical / dated audit & design logs
docs/release-audit/
docs/design/
docs/architecture/github-transition/
AUDIT.md

